# ⚠️ The Calibre-Web Automated data root — the Calibre library, its metadata.db,
# CWA's config, and the ebook files themselves.
#
# NEVER commit this. It is gigabytes of book files, it is the one directory in
# this repo that grows without bound, and this household has already had a
# repo-size incident (377MB .git) force a hosting migration. CWA owns these
# files; git has no business with them.
#
# Note this is the OPPOSITE of the rule in audiobook_catalog, where site/ and the
# covers are deliberately tracked because the deploy ships them from git. That
# repo publishes its outputs; this one serves from D1 and Workers assets, so
# nothing here needs a file to survive in a commit.
runtime/

# Agent worktrees: throwaway git repos created by Claude Code sessions.
# They were committed by accident on 2026-08-10 as embedded repos (gitlinks),
# which clone as empty directories and confuse every later status.
.claude/worktrees/
